        (`Provision of the Code` OF 146, "(1)")        -- (i) subsection 146(1)
      , (`Provision of the Code` OF 153, "(1)(a)")     -- (ii) paragraph 153(1)(a)

-- Paragraphs (a) to (d) together: is the stated provision one the definition lists, under the Code the offence is under?
GIVEN offence IS A `s 752 offence`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 752 primary designated offence (a) to (d) the provision is listed` MEANS
    CONSIDER offence's `s 752 source`
    WHEN `s 752 an offence under this Act as it now reads`
        THEN `s 752 the provision is in the list` (offence's `s 752 provision`) `s 752 primary designated offence (a) the listed provisions`
    WHEN `s 752 an offence under the Criminal Code, chapter C-34 of the Revised Statutes of Canada, 1970`
        THEN     (    Day (offence's `s 752 date committed`) LESS THAN Day (Date 4 1 1983)
                  AND (    `s 752 the provision is in the list` (offence's `s 752 provision`) `s 752 primary designated offence (b) the listed provisions`
                        OR (    `s 752 the provision is the entry` (offence's `s 752 provision`) `s 752 primary designated offence (b)(vi) the conditional entry`
                            AND offence's `s 752 intent was to commit an offence in subparagraphs (i) to (v) of paragraph (b)`)))
              OR (    Day (offence's `s 752 date committed`) LESS THAN Day (Date 1 1 1988)
                  AND `s 752 the provision is in the list` (offence's `s 752 provision`) `s 752 primary designated offence (d) the listed provisions`)
    WHEN `s 752 an offence under the Criminal Code, chapter C-34, as enacted by section 19 of chapter 125 of the Statutes of Canada, 1980-81-82-83`
        THEN `s 752 the provision is in the list` (offence's `s 752 provision`) `s 752 primary designated offence (c) the listed provisions`
    WHEN `s 752 an offence under this Act as it read before the day on which paragraph (c.1) of the definition of designated offence comes into force`
        THEN FALSE

